Every icon pack keeps its own licence beside its files:

  common/   Veluna window controls plus Simple Icons brand marks (CC0 1.0)
  lucide/   Lucide (ISC)
  iconoir/  Iconoir (MIT)
  remix/    Remix Icon 4.8.0 (Apache 2.0)
  solar/    Solar Icon Set, Linear style (CC BY 4.0, attribution required)

scripts/fetch-icons.py rebuilds every pack except lucide and common.
